Copyright 2026 Dynatrace LLC

This directory contains the following components, vendored from
Tobias Rauter's dt-otel-k8s-platform-monitoring
(https://github.com/trauter/dt-otel-k8s-platform-monitoring), commit
72bed8b88e727b1edf5f3e33460f1bf51bf7b5e6 (2026-10-13), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE):

  processor/dtk8stopology        (upstream processor/dtk8stopology)
  processor/dtk8seventsprocessor (upstream processor/dtk8seventsprocessor)
  connector/alertingengine       (upstream connector/alertingengine)

Modifications by Bluebox:
  - module path changed to github.com/pawelsiwek/bluebox-k8s-collector/collector
    (one module instead of three) and built against OpenTelemetry Collector
    v0.162.0 / v1.68.0, the release the pinned Dynatrace distribution uses;
  - alertingengine: the error from forwarding alert records to the next
    consumer is logged instead of discarded;
  - added connector/alertingengine/connector_test.go.

The binary is assembled with the OpenTelemetry Collector Builder from the
Dynatrace distribution manifest (https://github.com/Dynatrace/dynatrace-otel-collector,
tag v0.58.1, Apache-2.0) and OpenTelemetry Collector components
(Apache-2.0).
